G校正。","新增的景觀大湖、圓廣場、建物層數及球場位置不作建模來源；校園17棟完整樓層與尺寸仍以原生SVG為準。"],"geometry_approved":false,"actual_tripo_model":false,"unchanged_image_rebindings":[{"previous_design_sha256":"28ace3b46dd685054ab5178be2747c88cffa403bc765db9273d7e01ed6ce3b0c","current_design_sha256":"5a08344a77428d71be5134c2c113796ff3f835e0132ed9e1ecd4a8be20f52615","proof":{"previous_design_sha256":"28ace3b46dd685054ab5178be2747c88cffa403bc765db9273d7e01ed6ce3b0c","visual_input_sha256":"29c65a4a9e46c283c6a24febbaefe90edefadc029dc896c0b316fa76c219d05a"}}]},"design_sha256":"5a08344a77428d71be5134c2c113796ff3f835e0132ed9e1ecd4a8be20f52615"},{"id":"street","title":"學生商店街","image_file":"output/street-social-city-production/scene-concepts/street/concept.jpg","image_sha256":"b7d485e1d15773c87661b99c93ea68f34817a7fcab70f811ace6530e78685cce","review":{"reviewed_by":"Codex","review_method":"direct_image_inspection","image_sha256":"b7d485e1d15773c87661b99c93ea68f34817a7fcab70f811ace6530e78685cce","design_sha256":"7d5f8bd3f73a5169e4ca63928b093a3f76987d8004155cb733eb9c176a4db8db","observations":["圖上包含S01–S96四排店屋，北、南各一對相向入口，中央橫向道路分隔兩街區。","原圖有個別門牌誤寫及屋頂邊線微調；其文字及像素邊界不作公尺尺寸依據。","street-image-plan.svg保留96棟獨立原生向量店屋及入口、步道；每間店另有圖稿與轉繪SVG。"],"geometry_approved":false,"actual_tripo_model":false,"corrected_vector_file":"street-image-plan.svg","unchanged_image_rebindings":[{"previous_design_sha256":"f938dcdb93195f10bf72c95f451d80a525a58eba1d306ff385b8324c05fc2134","current_design_sha256":"7d5f8bd3f73a5169e4ca63928b093a3f76987d8004155cb733eb9c176a4db8db","proof":{"previous_design_sha256":"f938dcdb93195f10bf72c95f451d80a525a58eba1d306ff385b8324c05fc2134","visual_input_sha256":"4b4a453540981b4ff9a0a719127cb17595f7f99f7112b27c1758d83837ccc3ce"}}]},"design_sha256":"7d5f8bd3f73a5169e4ca63928b093a3f76987d8004155cb733eb9c176a4db8db"},{"id":"mall","title":"百貨與辦公區","image_file":"output/street-social-city-production/scene-concepts/mall/concept.jpg","image_sha256":"361b6d359e3a7562636572981b0630a83704d5c756d7ca7777683e338a80ac2b","review":{"rev